      <MissionDesc>THE MISSION OF COMMUNITY HEALTH IMPROVEMENT PARTNERS IS TO ADVANCE SUSTAINABLE SOLUTIONS TO PRIORITY HEALTH NEEDS THROUGH COLLABORATION AND COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT.</MissionDesc>
